meta {
  name: 01_ClientsAndKeyRoleParties
  seq: 1
}

docs {
  Scenario: The accounting firm's daily leader lists authorized parties

    When the daily leader of the accounting firm lists authorized parties
    Then the response is a paginated envelope with a party list
    And the accounting firm itself appears as a key role party with its subunit
    And the client organisations appear with the packages held through the client role
    And the owner of a sole proprietorship client appears as a person party
    And no party appears twice anywhere in the response
}
